subckt_param: a subcircuit instance with a parameter: a divider whose lower leg is the instance's rlo
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
subckt div(top mid)
  parameters rlo=1k
  r1 (top mid) resistor r=1k
  r2 (mid 0) resistor r=rlo
ends
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=3.0
x1 (in out) div rlo=2k
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
